exports[`Builtin resources, STDIO should read meta resources, patternfly-components-meta 1`] = `
{
  "mimeType": "text/markdown",
  "text": "# PatternFly Components Index Metadata
Use these parameters to filter the list of PatternFly components.

## Available Parameters

| Parameter | Valid Values | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| \`category\` | \`accessibility\`, \`css\`, \`design-guidelines\`, \`development-guide\`, \`html\`, \`org-demos\`, \`overview\`, \`react\`, \`text\`, \`text-demos\`, \`text-deprecated\` | Filter by category |
| \`version\` | \`v5\`, \`v6\` | Filter by version |

## Available Patterns
- **Base View**: \`patternfly://components/index\`
- **Filtered View (version=...)**: \`patternfly://components/index?version=...\`
- **Filtered View (version=...&category=...)**: \`patternfly://components/index?version=...&category=...\`",
  "uri": "patternfly://components/meta",
}
`;

exports[`Builtin resources, STDIO should read meta resources, patternfly-docs-meta 1`] = `
{
  "mimeType": "text/markdown",
  "text": "# PatternFly Documentation Index Metadata
Use these parameters to filter the documentation index.

## Available Parameters

| Parameter | Valid Values | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| \`category\` | \`about\`, \`about-rapid-prototyping\`, \`accessibility\`, \`analytics\`, \`chat-bot\`, \`css\`, \`customizing%20messages\`, \`dark-theme-handbook\`, \`demo\`, \`demo-demos\`, \`design-guidelines\`, \`design-tokens\`, \`development-guide\`, \`development-guidelines\`, \`enhancing-existing-projects\`, \`general\`, \`glass-mode-handbook\`, \`grammar\`, \`high-contrast-handbook\`, \`html\`, \`new-prototypes\`, \`org-demos\`, \`overview\`, \`react\`, \`release-notes\`, \`text\`, \`text-demos\`, \`text-deprecated\`, \`tree-shaking\`, \`upgrade-guide\`, \`writing-guidelines\`, \`writing-guides\` | Filter by category |
| \`collection\` | \`patternfly-api\`, \`patternfly-component-schemas\`, \`patternfly-docs\` | Filter by collection |
| \`section\` | \`accessibility\`, \`ai\`, \`charts\`, \`components\`, \`content-design\`, \`developer-guides\`, \`extensions\`, \`foundations-and-styles\`, \`get-help\`, \`get-involved\`, \`get-started\`, \`layouts\`, \`patterns\`, \`releases\`, \`upgrade\` | Filter by section |
| \`version\` | \`v4\`, \`v5\`, \`v6\` | Filter by version |

## Available Patterns
- **Base View**: \`patternfly://docs/index\`
- **Filtered View (version=...)**: \`patternfly://docs/index?version=...\`
- **Filtered View (category=...)**: \`patternfly://docs/index?category=...\`
- **Filtered View (version=...&category=...)**: \`patternfly://docs/index?version=...&category=...\`
- **Filtered View (section=...)**: \`patternfly://docs/index?section=...\`
- **Filtered View (version=...&section=...)**: \`patternfly://docs/index?version=...&section=...\`
- **Filtered View (category=...&section=...)**: \`patternfly://docs/index?category=...&section=...\`
- **Filtered View (version=...&category=...&section=...)**: \`patternfly://docs/index?version=...&category=...&section=...\`
- **Filtered View (collection=...)**: \`patternfly://docs/index?collection=...\`
- **Filtered View (version=...&collection=...)**: \`patternfly://docs/index?version=...&collection=...\`
- **Filtered View (category=...&collection=...)**: \`patternfly://docs/index?category=...&collection=...\`
- **Filtered View (version=...&category=...&collection=...)**: \`patternfly://docs/index?version=...&category=...&collection=...\`
- **Filtered View (section=...&collection=...)**: \`patternfly://docs/index?section=...&collection=...\`
- **Filtered View (version=...&section=...&collection=...)**: \`patternfly://docs/index?version=...&section=...&collection=...\`
- **Filtered View (category=...&section=...&collection=...)**: \`patternfly://docs/index?category=...&section=...&collection=...\`
- **Filtered View (version=...&category=...&section=...&collection=...)**: \`patternfly://docs/index?version=...&category=...&section=...&collection=...\`",
  "uri": "patternfly://docs/meta",
}
`;

